procedure:- 
1. sign in to the aws management console and open aws lambda
2. click create function and select author from scratch 
3. enter the function naame, select the required runtime (eg Python) and configure the IAM function 
4. open the code section and write the lambda function 
5. click test, create a test event, and run the function 
6. check the execution results to verify the output 
7. optionally, deploy the function using services such as API gateway, S3 or Step Functions 
8. monitor the function using Amazon cloudwatch 